Q: Android: Add new buildType - Unable to find a matching configuration of project A: <p>In your project called "common", in build.gradle, add build type definition you just added to the main project. Like so:</p>

<pre><code>android {
    buildTypes {
        release {}
        debug {}
        debugTest {}
    }
}
</code></pre>

